    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Muruuwí tleehheek dír Aroni nee daaqaywós as kiwa paratl tawa kaahamuusér aníng i sagadiyuus: Tsa/atamoó awu na slaweek, nee gwaandaawér tsár ar xaslxaansli wasl, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee mikaátér ta sluuftisiiká nee mandasoó taa sluuftisiiká oo taa tleéhh ar di/i, nee mikaátér ninakw ar taa tleéhh ar di/i nee ar taa sluuftisiiká, muruuwí sleémeero gár kur tlehha' a puuruú natsaatsaá' oo angaáno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaátedá' ka qás baraá katati, daqaní ngi hanís aníngí ale, dinkwa nee awuudá' nee gwaandaaweedá' tsaraawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Daqaní Aroni nee daaqaywose ki húp ay dír afkú heémár Mungú, ki hamátl ar ma'aay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo tlabaadaá kahamuusi'iima ki Aroni dahás, hiyaydá' tleér nee kudá' ququmaare, nee naifeéra nee tlakwayduú da/eewo. Himuudá' taa tleehhamo hhe'eés oo naifeéra ku afeetloowós i tsék. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kofiyaádá' ka dahás gawaá sagós, slamangwdá' hhoohhoó' ku gawaá kofiyaádá' i qás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruuwí bura hhe'és tleehhamooro, ku di/tár iimbaláx as kuwa baraá gadiyeédií dahas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Daqaní daaqoó Aroni ngu húp ki tsiitís ar hiyi'iidá' tlet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Him'eedár afeetler'ín an tsék, nee kofiyaduín kiri dahás. Asma adoorí an adór Aroni nee daaqaywós kir hhohhoes tawa kaahamuuser'eé' daqisleém.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Daqaní tsa/atamoodá' ngu húp dír heémár Mungú as Aroni nee daaqaywós dabaaín ngiwa qaasiya' gawaá ságw tsa/atamoowí. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní tsa/atamoodá' ku gás dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ didár dahmaá afkú heémár Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tseerér niina ar awuudá' ka taatáhh, nee ka slík ar ditsaawók baraá xareemidaá kitángw ilahhooa, nee tseeredár hatlá' aa met ka ku'ús baraá ya'aá kitángw ilahhooa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní wayo sleémeero awa baraá waqát nee daeero nee gumbayaaya' nee wayoodá' gawaawose, sleémeero ki dá/ gawaá kitángw ilahhooa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala fu'unaá awuudá' nee kaahartose nee saankarose ki da/tá eér tsee/aá didá' kuungá' ti diria', asma ilahhooarí ar dakuús hingeesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gwaanduú wák baraá gwaandaaweedá' tsare taatahheek, daqaní Aroni nee daaqaywose ki ádbeér dabaaín ngiwa qaasiya' gawaá sagós i ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng gwaanduudá' ku gás, daqaní tseereerós ka hikimís gawaá kitángw ilahhooa baduwós tsiyahhaawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní gwaanduudá' ku supiín, waqatuuwós ku hamátl nee ya'aawose, sleémeero ki dinkwárí qás nee sagose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní fu'uunaydá' sleémeero ki dá/ gawaá kitángw ilahhooa as ilahhooadár da/a/aangw ngiwa aníng i hanis, slaahhareeridá' tsuú' awa ilahhooadá' anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iri sla'atisiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng gwaanduduú hatlá' ku léhh, daqaní Aroni nee daaqaywós dabaaín ngi gawaá ságw gwaandudií qaasiye'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní ku gás, tseereerós ka bahh taatáhh, ka slík ar sagér iaá doó /iyáy awa Aroni nee awa daaqaywós, nee dugeenaá dabér doó /iyáy, ka male slík nee ar dugeenaá ya'aá doó /iyáy, tseerér aa met ka hikimís gawaá kitangwduú ilahhooa baduuwós sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tseereedár gawaá kitángw ilahhooárí dirii' ka bahh taatáhh, nee di/tadár iimbalaxaango ka tsipipi'ís gawaá Aroni nee gawaá tlabaawós, ka male tsipipi'ís gawaá daaqaywós nee gawaá tlabaaín. Daqaní Aroni nee daaqaywose kaa hhoohhooeés tawa kwe'eé' nee sleémeero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Di/tá gwaandudá' sleeme ka hingés, nee hhayshowose, nee wayoodaá baraá guruuwo, nee daeero, nee gumbayaayá' tsaraawo, nee tlawanqár gawaawose, nee yaaeerós ar doó /iyayhe. Asma a gwaanduú inooín kira paraátl as gadiyér Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá katatidár dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ diriia, tidá' mikaátér taa sluuftisiiká ga koóm, mukaatmoó wák ku taatáhh nee mandasamoó wák oo taa di/tár tleéhh nee mukaátmoó wák oo niiná. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruuwí sleémeero dír Aroni nee daaqaywós ti hanis, inooín ngi gáwtí tleesiye' as tawa slaqsoó ilahhooár tinda anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i haniís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruuwí ku dir'ín wa ar tleér ku dá/ gawaá kitángw ilahhooa dinkwa nee ilahhooadá' ta da/a/an as tawa slaahhareeraá aníng i sla'atimiisá'. Asma gaarí an ilahhooadá' ta hanmiisi dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ar loohirí kawa da/aa/an.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Daqaní da/eewaá gwaanduudá' taa Aronír hhoohhooeesi ki taatáhh, daqaní ki gáwtí tlés adór gár taa AAKOÓ MUNGÚ hanmiisi, daqaní da/eewosíng a kók.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Qoomár kaahamusmoó Mungú bar ku paraatl as Mungú, da/eewo nee manguduú alu oo gwaanduudá' taa kaahamusmór paraátl, kingi amor'eení huwi as kiwa paraatli ar loohír kiwa gáwtí tleesi, daqaní kari hanís dír Aroni nee daaqaywós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe xoorór Israeli daqisleém baraá ilahhooar'ín tidár wayda i hanmamisia dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, da/eewo nee manguú aluuwo kin haniis dír Aroni nee daaqaywós. Gaarí an ilahhooar'ín ar wayda ar ta haniisi dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Barnaxés Aroni aa gwaá' tlabaawós kudá' hhohho' ki daaqaywós i haniis, inooín ngin dahaasiyá' bál birki iimbalaax nee ki dákwí qaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garmoó Aroni oo gadiyér aakoó dooín ga óh, tlabaádá' hhohho' gin dahaas deelo faanqw ar iwa gadiyuusi didá' hhoohhoo' ar heémár Mungú.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Daqaní kuúng fu'unaá gwaandudá' kira parátl ki humiín didá' hhoohhoó' wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni nee daaqaywós fu'unaasingá' ngi /ayiye' dír afkú heémaadá' wá ale, dinkwa nee mikaátedá' baraá katatírí diri'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín muruudá' sleémeero kira paraátl nee kira baraá gadiyeédí qaás ngu /ayiye', ala heé hatlá' mingiwa /aáy, asma kaa paraátl as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá fu'unaydá' nee mikaáteéro miwa gaa mét ay bál tsár, ala birna meetiyé' ki dá/ baraá asla, mikiwa /aay asma kaa hhoohhooeés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Muruuwí un tléhh dír Aroni nee daaqaywós ar adoodá' ura hara'ayiím, in parátl deelo faanqwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám umuú deelooro awu un hanmís, as tawa ilahhooár tlakweema hingeesa as haraki/isa kawa tlehh. Daqaní didá' ilahhooa kawa hanmamiisi aga hhoohhoés, di/i ka gawaadá' i tsipipi'ís as kawa paratl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng ilahhooa an hanmís deelo faanqw as kitángw ilahhooa kawa harki/ís nee kawa hhoohhooes. Daqaní kitángw ilahhooa kawa hanmamisi ku ló'wa hhoohhoó', as kahhó' umuú gár gu kwatiita aqo in hhoohhoouúr.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«De'emaá hi'iita'a umuú daqto ilahhooár ta hanmisa' dír kitángw ilahhooaro a tí: Deeloó tsár oo bee/aangw oo kurkú wák. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wák matlaatleero un gás nee oo tsár qoomár tsiindo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwaanduduú matlaatle un hanís dinkwa nee kílór wák ar puuruú natsaatsaá', oo taa aledoók nee di/tá hhohho' ar har liítár wák nee difaáír liíta wak, as kahhó' tawa ilahhooár muruú wahaangw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sleeme deelmooduú tsár un gás qoomár tsiindoowo, kuri ilahhooár wa hanís dinkwa nee ilahhooár balaangw nee ar wahaangw, adór kuduú matlaatle, ku dá/ baraá asla, slaahhareeraá ilahhooasíng anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iri sla'atisiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilahhooasír da/a/aangw umuú daqto kan hanmiis baraá qari sleémeero ar hi'iita geeraá afkú heémár Mungú, didá' aníng nee kuungá' ti dogitaan nee niwa amorhúng i axwees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng nee xoorór Israeli tin didaádií dogiitaán, nee xirfuueé' heémaadá' gari hhoohhoees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng heémaadá' ti dogiitaan ngari hhohhoeés dinkwa nee kitángw ilahhoa kawa hanmamisi. Tam Aroni nee daaqaywose sleeme in hhoohhooeés as inooín tawa kaahamuusér aníng i sagadiyuus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng nari hoót baraá tla/ángw múk Israelír wa alé. Aníng tari Munguúín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní xoorór Israeli aníng iri tsáhh adór tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúín, kudá' inooín gaa duux baraá yaamaá Misrír wa ale, as niwa baraá tla/angw'ín wa hoot, aníng an AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúín.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
